{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99239","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99239/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99239/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99239/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99239","id":2659270978,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6egUFC","number":99239,"title":"`IsInstanceValid` called before the end of the frame returns true on an object that called `QueueFree`","user":{"login":"IurieYSI","id":60746396,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNzQ2Mzk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60746396?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IurieYSI","html_url":"https://github.com/IurieYSI","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IurieYSI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IurieYSI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IurieYSI/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IurieYSI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IurieYSI/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IurieYSI/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IurieYSI/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IurieYSI/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IurieYSI/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","color":"b64245","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2024-11-14T15:56:50Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T06:45:39Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\ntested on v4.3.stable.mono.official\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot v4.3.stable.mono.official\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf we call `node.QueueFree()`, `IsInstanceValid(node)` should return `false` even before the end of the frame.\r\nI can't think of a reason why would anyone need to have `IsInstanceValid(node)` returning true after a `node.QueueFree()` call.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a node,\r\n2. Print out `IsInstanceValid`\r\n3. QueueFree the node\r\n4. Print out `IsInstanceValid`\r\n\r\nIt prints out\r\n```\r\ntrue\r\ntrue\r\n```\r\n\r\nand I think it must print out\r\n\r\n```\r\ntrue\r\nfalse\r\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n```\r\nColorRect n = new ColorRect();\r\nAddChild(n);\r\nGD.Print(IsInstanceValid(n));\r\nn.QueueFree();\r\nGD.Print(IsInstanceValid(n));\r\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99239/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99239/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}